    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58747" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολύμφατος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός, λεπίδιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμφάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμβάω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυρίζοντες:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκενοῦντες</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυτέα</span></b> , ἡ, <i>bladdersenna, Colutea arborescens</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.14.4
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλυτρον</span></b> , τό, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλυθρον</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολύφανον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός, λεπύριον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελύφανον</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυφρόν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαφρόν</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλφος</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλπος</span>
			, <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
